    accTitle: M6 review gate sequence
    accDescr: A ready diff enters focused gates, parallel Thermos review, a finding-return loop, settlement, independent review, merge, and post-merge proof.
    A["1 · Ready<br/>Diff + focused gates"] --> B["2 · Gates<br/>Quality preflight"]
    B --> C["3 · Thermos<br/>Parallel bug/security + quality"]
    C --> D["4 · Return<br/>Synthesis sends fixes back"]
    D --> E["5 · Settle<br/>Threads + review signals"]
    E --> F["6 · Review<br/>Independent review"]
    F --> G["7 · Merge<br/>Current authority"]
    G --> H["8 · Prove<br/>Post-merge check"]
    D -->|real findings| A
